Domain setup for ROMS 

roms/Gridpak/Include/gridparam.h.in
It should be src/rop_pre/Gridpak/Include/gridname.h.in

     integer         L, M
!     parameter( LPLUS1=@IGRD@, MPLUS1=@JGRD@ )
!     parameter( L=LPLUS1-1 , M=MPLUS1-1 )
     parameter( L=@IGRD@ , M=@JGRD@ )
!
!  mud2 requires that these values satisfy
!
!     L = NXL*2**(NSTEP-1)+1
!     M = NYL*2**(NSTEP-1)+1
!
!  where NXL, NYL and NSTEP are integers.  Try to have NSTEP as large as
!  possible (see mud2 documentation).
!
!  subroutine 'factor' now takes care of passing NXL, NYL and NSTEP to mud2.

The IGRID and JGRID are from the rsm domain definition by configure-model.

This will generate a grid.nc file.
Then all the other ROMS program will inquiry this netCDF file to get the x, y dimensions.

